% Backward goal: recursive ancestor with budget cap (max_answers=2).
% Full ancestor set over a→b→c→d would be {b,c,d}; capped at 2 → {b,c}, status partial.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/profiles/goal-budget-trip/').
ex:ancestor(X,Y) :- ex:parentOf(X,Y).
ex:ancestor(X,Y) :- ex:parentOf(X,Z), ex:ancestor(Z,Y).
?- ex:ancestor(ex:a, Y).
